Gummel-Poon BJT amplifier transient
vin in 0 pulse(0 10m 1u 10n 10n 2u 5u)
vcc vcc 0 9
rs in ns 600
cin ns nb 1u
rb1 vcc nb 82k
rb2 nb 0 15k
rc vcc nc 3.3k
re ne 0 330
ce ne 0 10u
cl nc out 1u
rl out 0 10k
